\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 Effects of passing[{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Gravitational_wave&action=edit&section=3"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \ul edit}}]
\f1\b0\fs24 \
